  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ucx6](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ucx6) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 119.267 depth occurred on Nov 23 2026 181 km NE of Lospalos, Timor Leste. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.4408 longitude 128.2414. It impacted 634 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
